@startuml
title Plane State Transition Diagram

[*] --> Order

state Order
Order : entry/Place in order state
Order : do/Wait for delivery
Order : exit/Delivered

state Delivered
Delivered : entry/Plane delivered
Delivered : do/Transition to Arrival
Delivered : exit/Arrival

state Arrival
Arrival : entry/Plane arrives
Arrival : do/Assign to Preparation
Arrival : exit/Preparation

state Preparation
Preparation : entry/Prepare plane
Preparation : do/Check and service plane
Preparation : exit/Ready for operations or maintenance

state Operations
Operations : entry/In operation
Operations : do/Keep in operation if flights are scheduled
Operations : exit/Maintenance required or no more flights

state Maintenance
Maintenance : entry/Plane needs maintenance
Maintenance : do/Service and check plane
Maintenance : exit/Preparation

state OutOfService
OutOfService : entry/Plane is out of service
OutOfService : do/Remove from operations permanently
OutOfService : exit/Final state

state RemovedFromOperations
RemovedFromOperations : entry/Plane removed from operations
RemovedFromOperations : do/No more use for the plane
RemovedFromOperations : exit/End

Delivered --> Arrival
Arrival --> Preparation
Preparation --> Operations
Operations --> Maintenance
Maintenance --> Preparation
Preparation --> OutOfService
OutOfService --> RemovedFromOperations

@enduml
